  "name": "Frijoles a la Charra",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked pinto beans with bacon, beer, and jalapeños",
  "description": "Pinto beans simmer with smoky bacon, vegetables, beer, and cilantro for a hearty Mexican-style side dish.",
